# Files that must not be published. gitignore syntax.
#
# UNVERIFIED: I could not confirm from Cloudflare's docs that Workers static
# assets honours this file. If the paths below are still reachable after a
# deploy, it is not supported here, and the fallback is cf-build.sh plus a build
# command ("bash cf-build.sh", output "_site"). Nothing here is secret either
# way: tools/ holds the SEO build scripts and no credentials.
tools
cf-build.sh
staticwebapp.config.json
wrangler.jsonc
.assetsignore
.github
README.md
